sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Chatbot.jsx
  participant R as RagChat
  participant S as ragStore TF-IDF
  participant O as OpenAI API
  U->>C: types what about by gender
  C->>R: generateResponse with onChunk
  R->>R: isProjectQuery and isCrossDatasetQuery both false
  R->>S: tfidfSearch query k=24
  S-->>R: scored docs with boosts
  R->>S: tfidfSearch with session dataset prepended
  S-->>R: extra docs merged, top 12 kept
  R->>R: buildContext tags each doc
  R->>O: POST chat completions stream true
  O-->>R: data lines with content deltas
  R-->>C: onChunk accumulated text
  C-->>U: message updates with blinking cursor
  O-->>R: DONE
  R-->>C: final answer saved to history
